# Component Guidance

- Default to server components where appropriate, keep client bundles small and isolate stateful interaction.
- Favor clear component responsibility and meaningful extraction, not arbitrary maximum file length.
- Preserve accessible names, focus visibility, keyboard behavior and reduced-motion support.
- Avoid touch-only hover behavior and avoid unnecessary layout shift.
- Test with the current React 19/Next.js 16 setup and existing runtime-motion scripts before replacing animation systems.
